    {
      "en": "scene rainking3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rainking3.webp",
      "alt": "rainking3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Let’s have a talk, shall we?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You don’t need to respond or anything. I’ll handle all of the heavy lifting since you seem pretty tied up at the moment.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I hope you’re having a nice week. Good things are pretty hard to come by in these parts, aren’t they?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, let’s see here...where should I begin?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, first thing’s first, it’s not very polite to touch things that don’t belong to you. And it’s especially not polite to try guessing somebody else’s password.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What if I had some really weird stuff on my computer that made you change the way you look at me forever?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t, of course. I’m a good girl. And the only person I’ll ever have any attraction to sleeps right next door to my room, so I’d get nothing out of looking up inappropriate videos anyway.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hmm....what else...what else?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh! There was a caterpillar on the door when I came home the other day. That was an interesting thing that happened.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I took some pictures. Do you want to see?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You don’t? How come?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wow. That’s really interesting. I had no idea you felt that way.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So anyway, I’ve been thinking — you and I have known each other for a while now, and I think it’s about time I’m given a more important role in your life.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes, I know my role is already important. But I think there’s a lot I can do that I haven’t been able to show you yet.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And yeah, some of that is because you spend most of your time on people who aren’t me- but I’m starting to think that’s just because I’m not appealing to you the way I’m supposed to.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Contrary to what many people believe, I am the main heroine here after all.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m the first one that shows up. The first one that falls in love. And I’ve held your hand through a billion different scenarios.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’d be nowhere without me, whether you want to believe that or not. But sometimes, it feels like I don’t get the recognition I deserve.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, every once in a while, I think we should have a nice little heart-to-heart like this.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just to see if there’s anything one of us is doing that the other doesn’t approve of. Or something we think the other should change.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Here. You can start. What’s something about me you want to change?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nothing? Really?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, come on. There’s gotta be something.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rainking4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rainking4.webp",
      "alt": "rainking4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Heheh! Now you’re just being a goober!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rainking5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rainking5.webp",
      "alt": "rainking5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But, listen — there’s something about you that I want to change.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Or rather, there’s something about the corner you’ve pushed me into that I’m not really comfortable with anymore. So I’d appreciate it if you’d let me sort of...reposition myself, if you will.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You see, it was never my intention to suffocate you. And I feel like, by declaring that I would stop doing that, I may have accidentally admitted I was in the wrong. Which I’m not.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If I’m really going to be the main heroine, which I am, I think it’s only fair that I get to be treated with a little more respect. Okay?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And the best way to respect me is by giving me a job no one else can do. A job more important than just cooking your dinner and washing your clothes.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rainking6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rainking6.webp",
      "alt": "rainking6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My dream job?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s a good question. I’ve always just kind of assumed I’d be a housewife.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But I think...if I got to choose anything in the world...",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’d be a teacher — just like my mom.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene itneverends7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/itneverends7.webp",
      "alt": "itneverends7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rainking7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rainking7.webp",
      "alt": "rainking7"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rainking8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rainking8.webp",
      "alt": "rainking8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wow! Now I am a teacher! It’s amazing what you can do if you really apply yourself, isn’t it?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Anyway, today’s lesson is on “understanding.” But what I mean by that is a little more complicated than simply “getting it,” you know?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": To understand something, you need to be able to process it in a way that makes sense to you on a personal level! Because once you’re able to “relate,” you’re really able to understand.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Now, many people may tell you that you’re able to understand things without relating to them, but those people are lying to you. And they’re normally the same people who think relatives shouldn’t have sex!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, if you listen to those people, you’ll wind up jaded and wrong and evil and you won’t actually “understand” anything because you were taught the wrong things before learning the right ones!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you following so far?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Great!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rainking9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rainking9.webp",
      "alt": "rainking9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Now that you understand the basics, I can begin to tell you about the first advanced principle of understanding — perception!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We’ve touched on the topic before under similar circumstances, but I’m going to expand on it to the best of my ability! Just be gentle with me since it’s my first day on the job.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You see, class- perception means more than just “the way a person sees something.”",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There is a hidden element to it, and that element can be dumbed down to “the way a person is made to see something.”",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This raises the question of whether or not it’s truly “perception” at all at that point because, if you’re only seeing something because you’re supposed to see it, are you really seeing anything at all?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": To provide a more specific example about what this means and how it relates to you in real life, imagine this!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A little girl loves her uncle but her uncle is supposed to think he loves somebody else so he doesn’t love his niece as much as he’s supposed to so he’s not properly “understanding” or “perceiving” the situation.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Because if he could understand and perceive the situation freely without interference from anyone else he’d understand and perceive that his prior misunderstood perception is...well, it’s bad! Do you get it?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rainking10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rainking10.webp",
      "alt": "rainking10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You don’t?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wow, this teaching thing is a lot harder than I thought it would be.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe I should just go back to being a student instead?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene itneverends7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/itneverends7.webp",
      "alt": "itneverends7"
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rainking11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rainking11.webp",
      "alt": "rainking11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s more like it. This is a setting I do better in.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What’s that? You think there’s something wrong with the class? Well, that’s probably just because you’re not “understanding” what’s going on right now! Hahah! Do you see what I did there?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I made a joke and this is the part where you’re supposed to praise me for it.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sensei, can I go to the bathroom to watch a concert or whatever?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This is stupid. I play the violin.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m Ami! Champion of Justice and whatever!",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": When my butler hears about this, he’s going to give me a gun.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Everyone be quiet, you are interrupting my learning.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What’s that?",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
