    {
      "en": ": Or at least it would be natural for most people. Your truth is that fear is alluring. It excites you in a way it’s not supposed to. And that’s something I can relate to.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
