      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It might not make the most sense from a logical standpoint, but it definitely sounds the nicest. And I like to think the two of them are hanging out up there and playing bingo or something.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Anyway, Maya never actually killed a kitten and the white car was ours. Are you close to waking up yet?",
