      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I hope not. But at the same time, I hope so because I’m not sure how much more of this I can take before I throw myself off of the roof.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You see, you hurt me a lot. All of you have been hurting me lately. It’s like you have a collective fetish for making cute redheads sad. And I try not to kink shame, but I’m not a big fan of that one.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What’s my biggest kink? I don’t have any. I’m a good girl. And incest doesn’t count. I just like knowing that if I bite my partner’s neck, the blood I’ll draw will be my own.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And no, I’m not a vampire. But it would be really cool if I was so I could stop aging and not run the risk of you getting less attracted to me as time goes on.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not like that’s ever going to happen in the first place. But, let’s face it, we both know this is the me you’ll like best. And I don’t blame you at all for that.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I wouldn’t blame you for liking the littler me either. Especially after doing the same thing to your computer that you did to mine and learning you’re even worse than everyone thinks you are.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And they think you’re gross, Sensei. Even if they want you to fuck them, they think you’re gross. They’re probably just wet from all the hormones and the fact that you’re super attractive.",
      "spk": "Ami",
      "spkColor": "#FF4DD2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But they all hate you and think you’re gross. Which is why you should love me and only me because I don’t think you’re gross. I think you’re awesome.",
